    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "raw": "[name=\"弑君者\"]    梅菲斯特？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "弑君者",
        "content": "梅菲斯特？"
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1507_Mephisto_1#6\",name2=\"char_1502_crowns#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
        "name2": "char_1502_crowns#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "raw": "[name=\"？？？\"]    你没有拒绝的理由吧？一些不小心飞进来的小虫子......值得你亲自追击吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "？？？",
        "content": "你没有拒绝的理由吧？一些不小心飞进来的小虫子......值得你亲自追击吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "raw": "[name=\"？？？\"]    我的部队已经接到了你的情报，你已经尽到了你的责任。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "？？？",
        "content": "我的部队已经接到了你的情报，你已经尽到了你的责任。"
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[name=\"？？？\"]    接下来，请你回去吧。毕竟你负责的是核心能源区及其外围......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "？？？",
        "content": "接下来，请你回去吧。毕竟你负责的是核心能源区及其外围......"
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1507_Mephisto_1#6\",name2=\"char_1502_crowns#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
        "name2": "char_1502_crowns#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[name=\"弑君者\"]    少做多余的事......！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "弑君者",
        "content": "少做多余的事......！"
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1507_Mephisto_1#6\",name2=\"char_1502_crowns#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
        "name2": "char_1502_crowns#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[name=\"？？？\"]    你还有其他事情要做，对吧？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "？？？",
        "content": "你还有其他事情要做，对吧？"
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1507_Mephisto_1#6\",name2=\"char_1502_crowns#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
        "name2": "char_1502_crowns#1",
        "focus": 2
